WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.706
Three real browsers

00:00:01.541 --> 00:00:02.354
one tab

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:03.592
zero installs

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.253
Side by Side

00:00:05.065 --> 00:00:06.055
