00:00:25.038 --> 00:00:25.745
or more

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:26.653
and the first

00:00:26.465 --> 00:00:27.761
visit downloads about

00:00:27.679 --> 00:00:28.929
eight hundred megabytes

00:00:28.741 --> 00:00:29.495
for the three

00:00:29.307 --> 00:00:30.108
browsers

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.644
Full story on

00:00:31.455 --> 00:00:32.351
